{"articleNo":"2236","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=2236&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"병무청 블로그 기자단 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.01.12","hit":"8994","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 185%; TEXT-INDENT: -18.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 31.9pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 24.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 185%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 19pt\">병무청 블로그 기자단 모집</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; MARGIN-LEFT: 13.3pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 24.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #364878; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">병</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; COLOR: #364878; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">무청에서는 병무행정에 대한 이해와 관심이 높은 블로그 기자 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; COLOR: #ff6600; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">‘청춘예찬 기</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; COLOR: #ff6600; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">자단’</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; COLOR: #364878; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">을 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; COLOR: #364878; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">모</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; COLOR: #364878; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">집합니다. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; COLOR: #364878; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">국민과의 소통을 통한 병역이 자랑스러운 세상 만들기에</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; COLOR: #364878; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 동참하고자 하시는 분들의 많은 참여 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-INDENT: -18.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 31.9pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 24.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 모집대상 및 인원</span></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#d7ebff\" height=\"18\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"122\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">모집분야</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#d7ebff\" height=\"18\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"92\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">모집인원</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#d7ebff\" height=\"18\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"339\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">지원자격</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: